flowchart TD
    accTitle: The layers of an API request
    accDescr: A request passes through the router, service, repository, and database. Each layer has one responsibility.
    U([Client request]) --> R["Router / handler<br/>Translate HTTP"]
    R --> S["Service<br/>Apply business rules"]
    S --> P["Repository<br/>Execute queries"]
    P --> D[("PostgreSQL<br/>Store data")]
